			"notes": "## ClassicGUIShop 1.4.1\n\n**Expanded compatibility**\n- Added support for **Minecraft 1.21.1 and 1.21.4**.\n- Broadened Fabric Loader compatibility across **all nine supported Minecraft versions**, this allows better mod pack compatibility.\n\n**Advancement Hunter Fix**\n- Recipe unlocks and internal advancements no longer appear in the reward list or grant money.\n\n**Supported Minecraft versions**\n`1.20.1 • 1.20.4 • 1.20.6 • 1.21.1 • 1.21.4 • 1.21.11 • 26.1.2 • 26.2 • 26.3`"
